"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-10-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"OH"},{"bioguideId":"M001210","fullName":"Rep. Murphy, Gregory F. [R-NC-3]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-11-17","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"J000309","fullName":"Rep. Jackson, Jonathan L. [D-IL-1]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-19","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IL"},{"bioguideId":"S001211","fullName":"Rep. Stanton, Greg [D-AZ-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-12-19","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"AZ"},{"bioguideId":"H001058","fullName":"Rep. Huizenga, Bill [R-MI-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2026-08-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MI"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T19:32:26+00:00","id":"hr1024-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-05","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-05","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Ways and Means."},"laws":[],"number":"1024","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Foreign Trade and International Finance","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"P000613","district":19,"fullName":"Rep. Panetta, Jimmy [D-CA-19]","party":"D","state":"CA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-05","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>US-Kazakhstan Trade Modernization Act</strong></p><p>This bill addresses trade between the United States and&nbsp;Kazakhstan.&nbsp;</p><p>Specifically, the bill authorizes the President to determine that&nbsp;Section 402 of the Trade Act of 1974 (commonly known as the Jackson-Vanik amendment) does not apply to Kazakhstan. The Jackson-Vanik amendment&nbsp;denies normal trade relations (NTR) status to some current and former&nbsp;nonmarket economy countries unless they comply with certain freedom-of-emigration requirements. Under a provision of this amendment, the President may&nbsp;extend NTR status to a country affected by the amendment by waiving the freedom-of-emigration requirements or determining that the country is not in violation of those requirements, subject to an annual review.&nbsp;Kazakhstan has received temporary NTR status since 1992.</p><p>Additionally, the bill authorizes the President to extend&nbsp;permanent NTR status to  Kazakhstan.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-09T12:55:55Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"US-Kazakhstan Trade Modernization Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-08-25T08:05:44Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-08-25T08:05:44Z"}
